09:24.790 --> 09:27.250
<i>I can't test her true abilities this way...</i>

09:27.250 --> 09:28.380
<i>All right!</i>

09:28.710 --> 09:32.710
Harukaze-senpai, I'm pretty used to this.

09:32.710 --> 09:35.880
You can go after me as much as you want!

09:36.800 --> 09:37.590
Here?

09:37.590 --> 09:40.300
A-As much as I want...

09:40.300 --> 09:42.060
You can't!

09:42.060 --> 09:43.680
How's this?

09:44.810 --> 09:47.270
You're too young, Yura-chan!

09:52.070 --> 09:53.030
Sorry!

09:53.030 --> 09:54.320
Are you okay?!

09:54.320 --> 09:54.690
Placeholder

09:54.320 --> 09:56.820
Wake up, Yura-chan!

09:54.690 --> 09:57.990
Her smash is pretty strong...

10:00.030 --> 10:02.080
Um... President Akiyama.

10:02.080 --> 10:02.960
Yes?

10:02.960 --> 10:06.460
Can we play some singles practice matches?

10:06.460 --> 10:08.670
With... me?

10:08.670 --> 10:09.580
Yes.

10:10.080 --> 10:14.420
Sorry, but I have to decline your request.

10:16.010 --> 10:24.100
I analyzed your hitting power, playing judgment, ball control, and especially your sense for the ball.

10:24.100 --> 10:29.600
It's still too early for you to challenge me.

10:29.600 --> 10:31.900
I-I see.

10:31.900 --> 10:35.730
<i>Are you saying my skills are so bad I can't even be your practice opponent?</i>

10:35.730 --> 10:38.450
Don't sweat it.

10:38.450 --> 10:44.330
She is, without a doubt, the number one in Shiradama Middle.

10:44.330 --> 10:46.580
Just how strong is she?

10:48.160 --> 10:49.460
<i>She ran away.</i>

10:49.460 --> 10:53.550
<i>She really doesn't want to be made a fool by others on their first day.</i>

10:54.130 --> 10:55.920
What're you doing, Yura-chan?

10:57.010 --> 10:58.630
Ah, you mean this?

10:58.920 --> 11:01.130
It's just some taping.

11:01.130 --> 11:03.300
It felt like I twisted my leg a bit,

11:03.300 --> 11:06.390
so I'm taping the important parts.

11:06.390 --> 11:08.640
It helps prevent sprains.

11:10.060 --> 11:12.810
Taping the important parts...

11:13.900 --> 11:18.530
On the important parts... taping!

11:23.160 --> 11:25.280
Taping is...

11:25.280 --> 11:27.540
even more dangerous!

11:27.540 --> 11:29.540
It'll make you horny!

11:29.960 --> 11:33.050
Sorry, I don't know what you mean.

11:34.040 --> 11:36.750
<i>I've been observing Shiradama the entire day.</i>

11:36.750 --> 11:40.550
<i>It's my first time seeing a school so hard to get a handle on.</i>

11:40.550 --> 11:43.010
<i>How am I going to report this?</i>

11:45.720 --> 11:47.350
W-What?

11:48.060 --> 11:50.100
Water fight!

11:50.100 --> 11:51.560
We're wearing swimsuits anyway.

11:51.560 --> 11:53.900
It'll be fine to get wet!

11:53.900 --> 11:55.440
Play as hard as we can!

11:55.440 --> 11:59.570
That's the style of the Shiradama Middle Soft Tennis Club!

12:01.820 --> 12:02.990
That's right!

12:02.990 --> 12:05.070
Yura-chan, you should join in too!

12:05.070 --> 12:07.950
Don't hold back, just have fun!

12:13.930 --> 12:17.670
In that case I'll get serious as well!

12:23.300 --> 12:23.890
Watch.

12:28.970 --> 12:30.470
Come on!

12:59.380 --> 13:04.680
So, what information did you gather from your investigation of Shiradama Middle, Yura?

13:04.680 --> 13:08.470
{Yes.}My detailed investigation of everything,
from their daily lives to club training,

13:08.470 --> 13:12.180
leads me to say...

13:12.180 --> 13:13.390
That is...

13:14.180 --> 13:16.400
"Thanks for the good time!"

13:16.400 --> 13:17.400
That's all!

13:18.440 --> 13:21.110
Then what was the point of your investigation?!

13:21.110 --> 13:23.360
But!

13:25.490 --> 13:27.910
Weird. Where's Yura?

13:28.450 --> 13:32.490
Seems she had to transfer again because of her father's job.

13:38.130 --> 13:39.670
Camp?

13:41.250 --> 13:42.630
Camp.

13:42.630 --> 13:45.010
It's a last preparation for the tournament

13:45.010 --> 13:47.760
and should strengthen the team spirit.

13:48.180 --> 13:50.510
It's not mandatory though.

13:50.510 --> 13:52.310
You don't have to come, if you don't want to go.

13:52.310 --> 13:53.390
Totally...

13:53.390 --> 13:54.600
...not...

13:54.600 --> 13:55.890
...the case!

13:55.890 --> 13:57.060
Yup.

13:58.060 --> 14:00.810
I-I see... that's great.

14:03.650 --> 14:05.150
The blue sky,

14:05.150 --> 14:06.820
the white sand!

14:07.110 --> 14:08.490
Fish and drinks!

14:08.490 --> 14:13.830
A group... of youngsters playing... in the ocean.

14:09.570 --> 14:10.740
Watch this!

14:19.960 --> 14:24.130
That's what the camp should be like.

14:24.130 --> 14:26.340
But instead...

14:26.340 --> 14:30.640
Where the hell are we?!

14:31.180 --> 14:35.470
Hold on a little longer, just until
we reach the camp site, okay?

14:35.470 --> 14:39.060
My seaside adventure...

14:39.060 --> 14:42.360
Hey, how much farther do we have to walk?

14:42.360 --> 14:44.570
Hm, let's see...

14:44.570 --> 14:47.190
We got lost about an hour ago.

14:47.190 --> 14:48.900
And you still went on?!

14:48.900 --> 14:49.950
What're we gonna do?!

14:49.950 --> 14:50.990
Do something!

14:50.990 --> 14:52.530
Hey, calm down, Kotone!

14:51.620 --> 14:53.530
We should've stayed at home!

14:53.530 --> 14:56.790
Now, now. You don't have to be so worried.

14:56.790 --> 14:59.620
The camp is near the top.

14:59.620 --> 15:02.540
As long as we keep climbing up,
we'll definitely reach it.

15:03.340 --> 15:05.090
Isn't it the same in tennis?

15:05.420 --> 15:13.390
Practicing day by day,
naturally getting closer to the top.

15:17.350 --> 15:20.440
A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step!

15:21.650 --> 15:25.980
That from someone who could collapse on the next step...

15:28.490 --> 15:29.190
A snake!

15:29.190 --> 15:30.450
It's so big!

15:30.450 --> 15:32.820
Eli-chan, don't go over there! It's dangerous!

15:32.820 --> 15:34.450
It's okay.

15:34.450 --> 15:37.700
Non-poisonous snakes are really cute.

15:37.700 --> 15:39.960
They feel really nice.

15:39.960 --> 15:44.790
This feeling of being tightly bound makes you want to let go, but you can't.

15:47.210 --> 15:48.380
Placeholder

15:47.210 --> 15:53.140
Oh, snake! Oh, snake! Yes!

15:48.380 --> 15:52.260
The feeling of being tightly bound... unable to let go...

15:54.140 --> 15:57.060
If you need more, tell me!

15:57.060 --> 15:59.980
I accept your kindness.

16:00.600 --> 16:03.650
Are we there yet?

16:04.690 --> 16:07.270
My strength is at its limit!

16:08.110 --> 16:09.650
Hey, look over there!

16:10.360 --> 16:11.440
It's a river!

16:11.440 --> 16:14.450
Let's go take a bath and relax!

16:19.370 --> 16:21.200
Hey, this is?

16:21.200 --> 16:23.790
It's steam... isn't it?

16:25.210 --> 16:26.840
The temperature is perfect!

16:27.290 --> 16:28.630
This means...

16:28.630 --> 16:30.170
Could it be?

16:30.170 --> 16:31.630
A natural hot spring!

16:40.180 --> 16:42.180
Feels so good!

16:57.370 --> 16:59.490
Knowing that there's this hot spring,

16:59.490 --> 17:02.200
coming up the mountain wasn't too bad.

17:05.330 --> 17:07.170
<i>Wait, wait.</i>

17:09.130 --> 17:11.170
<i>Everyone's there.</i>

17:11.170 --> 17:14.010
<i>That means... could it be...</i>

17:15.430 --> 17:16.180
<i>Mishi?</i>

17:23.850 --> 17:26.900
But something's strange.

17:29.190 --> 17:30.270
What is it?

17:30.270 --> 17:31.780
Your face is red.

17:31.780 --> 17:33.360
Is the heat making you dizzy?

17:33.360 --> 17:37.660
S-Say, isn't this hot spring a little weird?

17:37.660 --> 17:38.740
Weird?

17:39.120 --> 17:42.120
There's something slippery.

17:42.910 --> 17:44.000
It feels...

17:46.160 --> 17:49.080
Could it be some sort of special property?

17:49.080 --> 17:51.210
M-Maybe...

17:51.210 --> 17:54.340
But, if this continues...

17:56.630 --> 17:59.430
If this continues, I will...

17:59.430 --> 18:00.600
become...

18:00.600 --> 18:04.680
become hot!

18:05.520 --> 18:07.640
Really hot!

18:10.310 --> 18:11.020
Safe.

18:15.740 --> 18:20.370
Costume specifically for amphibious movement, name subject to change.

18:20.740 --> 18:22.990
Still room for improvement.

18:24.240 --> 18:25.040
Wait.

18:28.620 --> 18:31.420
We should get out soon.

18:31.420 --> 18:34.420
The coach should be tired of waiting by now.

18:34.420 --> 18:36.420
I don't really want to leave.

18:36.420 --> 18:39.260
All right! Stamina recharged!

18:39.260 --> 18:40.970
Eli-chan, let's go!

18:40.970 --> 18:41.640
Sure!

18:43.760 --> 18:46.980
That was really a good bath.

18:46.980 --> 18:48.890
Just what you'd expect from a secret hot spring.

18:48.890 --> 18:53.610
Our exhaustion has blown away. I feel like I could take a bear on!

18:53.610 --> 18:54.900
You're exaggerating.

18:54.900 --> 18:57.490
No. Really, really!

19:09.250 --> 19:12.380
K-K-K-Kotone-chan, it's time for you to show your skills!

19:12.380 --> 19:13.080
All right...

19:15.420 --> 19:16.340
I'm so dead!

19:18.760 --> 19:21.930
You made it mad with the weird things you said before!

19:21.930 --> 19:23.510
Stop kidding!

19:23.510 --> 19:25.810
Enough of that! Let's get out of here qui—

19:25.810 --> 19:26.850
Chitose-san?!

19:28.270 --> 19:29.980
The strong prey on the weak!

19:29.980 --> 19:32.650
That's nature's absolute rule!

19:33.150 --> 19:34.810
Get close

19:34.810 --> 19:36.230
and...

19:36.230 --> 19:37.940
devour it!

19:46.160 --> 19:51.210
It will be a long time before I can walk the path of a true hunter.

19:51.210 --> 19:52.170
It's up to you!

19:52.170 --> 19:55.590
It didn't even bat an eyelid while going against berserker Chitose-san!?

20:04.800 --> 20:06.760
You're quite enduring.

20:06.760 --> 20:10.980
It's been a while since I could enjoy myself, not having to hold back.

20:10.980 --> 20:12.270
Kurusu-chan!

20:12.270 --> 20:13.560
Kurusu!

20:13.560 --> 20:14.600
Kurusu!

21:09.870 --> 21:10.990
<b>Soon...</b>

21:11.620 --> 21:13.500
Looks like he wants to give us a ride.

21:13.500 --> 21:15.460
I-I see.

21:16.460 --> 21:19.000
<i>I hope it doesn't want to be our personal maid.</i>

21:24.510 --> 21:27.010
Oh. We're here, we're here!

21:27.550 --> 21:29.640
Is this the camp?

21:32.390 --> 21:33.980
It's bigger than expected.

21:33.980 --> 21:36.310
Another fantasy-filled place.

21:36.310 --> 21:38.610
Kurokije, thank you!

21:38.610 --> 21:40.190
Goodbye, friend.

21:41.570 --> 21:44.530
Hey, there's a tennis court!

21:47.660 --> 21:51.160
Let's take a look... into this pitch-black hall.

21:52.290 --> 21:54.290
What is it, Kotone-ch—

21:58.920 --> 22:01.090
What happened here?

22:01.090 --> 22:04.010
Why are the people from Akadama...

22:04.010 --> 22:06.170
Wake up, Sumino!

22:06.170 --> 22:07.840
What happened?!

22:07.840 --> 22:09.890
Answer me!

22:09.890 --> 22:11.180
Seriously.

22:14.970 --> 22:20.060
I was looking forward to it, since they're regulars in the regionals.

22:20.060 --> 22:22.940
They weren't even fit to be warming-up opponents.

22:23.400 --> 22:25.440
How disappointing.

22:25.900 --> 22:29.450
Don't you think so too?

22:30.450 --> 22:34.080
All of you, from Shiradama Middle Soft Tennis Club.

22:54.260 --> 22:59.560
<b><i>I extended my arms up high</i></b>

22:54.260 --> 22:59.560
takaku takaku ude wo nobashita

22:54.260 --> 22:59.560
高く高く腕を伸ばした

22:59.640 --> 23:05.020
<b><i>Knowing that they wouldn't reach</i></b>

22:59.640 --> 23:05.020
todokanai koto kurai wakatteru kedo

22:59.640 --> 23:05.020
届かないことくらいわかってるけど

23:05.150 --> 23:10.360
<b><i>I might be a crybaby</i></b>

23:05.150 --> 23:10.360
nakimushi dakedo sonna jibun mo

23:05.150 --> 23:10.360
泣き虫だけどそんな自分も

23:10.530 --> 23:15.910
<b><i>But I just can't hate myself, so I'm still here</i></b>

23:10.530 --> 23:15.910
kirai ni wa narenakute mada koko ni iru

23:10.530 --> 23:15.910
キライにはなれなくてまだココに居る

23:16.740 --> 23:21.920
<b><i>I dream about a tomorrow that I see far away</i></b>

23:16.740 --> 23:21.920
aa kogareta ashita wa mada tooku de

23:16.740 --> 23:21.920
ああ　焦がれた明日はまだ遠くで

23:22.130 --> 23:26.670
<b><i>It's smiling, beckoning</i></b>

23:22.130 --> 23:26.670
waratte iru temaneki shinagara

23:22.130 --> 23:26.670
笑っている　手招きしながら

23:26.960 --> 23:32.840
<b><i>Count 1 2 3 and raise up your heels</i></b>

23:26.960 --> 23:32.840
ichi ni san kazoe kakato wo agete miru

23:26.960 --> 23:32.840
123　数えかかとを上げてみる

23:33.140 --> 23:37.720
<b><i>Do it a little more, then just a little more</i></b>

23:33.140 --> 23:37.720
mou sukoshi sou ato sukoshi kurikaeshite wa

23:33.140 --> 23:37.720
もう少し　そうあと少し　繰り返しては

23:37.930 --> 23:43.020
<b><i>If I take a breath as deep as I can</i></b>

23:37.930 --> 23:43.020
dekiru dake ookiku iki wo shite

23:37.930 --> 23:43.020
出来るだけ大きく息をして

23:43.190 --> 23:48.070
<b><i>And imagine myself flying in the skies</i></b>

23:43.190 --> 23:48.070
sora wo tobu imeeji wo sureba

23:43.190 --> 23:48.070
空を飛ぶイメージをすれば

23:48.650 --> 23:53.360
<b><i>Then I can go anywhere!</i></b>

23:48.650 --> 23:53.360
doko e datte ikeru yo hora ne

23:48.650 --> 23:53.360
どこへだって行けるよほらね

23:54.570 --> 24:01.160
<b><i>I'm still dreaming of that one day when I might be able to fly</i></b>

23:54.570 --> 24:01.160
itsuka toberu kana nante yume minagara

23:54.570 --> 24:01.160
いつか飛べるかな　なんて夢見ながら

24:11.840 --> 24:14.090
Softenni Preview Release Office!

24:14.090 --> 24:15.640
I am the presenter, Asuna.

24:15.640 --> 24:16.390
I'm Kotone.

24:16.390 --> 24:18.600
To all who like Hokkaido Soft Tennis:

24:18.600 --> 24:20.060
Thank you very much!

24:20.060 --> 24:23.020
We said it's a preview, so why aren't we previewing?

24:23.020 --> 24:24.600
I don't know.

24:23.690 --> 24:26.110
<b>Game 8</b>

24:23.690 --> 24:26.110
<b>The Top</b>

24:23.690 --> 24:26.110
<b>Next Episode:</b>

24:24.600 --> 24:26.020
See you next week!
